, University of London | Postgraduate Search\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b408cf5f4d17f12d\">>>", "url": "https://www.postgraduatesearch.com/courses/search/postgraduate/goldsmiths-university-of-london/ma-media-communications/52283980", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"75118dd233e698b5\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nFind out more about studying MA Media &amp; Communications at Goldsmiths, University of London? We&#x27;ve gathered all the key details, entry requirements, modules, fees, and more.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"75118dd233e698b5\">>>", "siteName": "www.postgraduatesearch.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f651d504842a665a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nDepartment of Media, Communications & Cultural Studies | 21 Masters\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f651d504842a665a\">>>", "url": "https://www.mastersportal.com/universities/5119/department-of-media-communications-cultural-studies.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f52456133c87613e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nBrowse 21 Masters at Department of Media, Communications &amp; Cultural Studies. Plus discover fees, scholarships, rankings, student reviews, admissions and more.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f52456133c87613e\">>>", "siteName": "www.mastersportal.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"80f40c2e8d5f7992\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMedia and Communications M.A. at Goldsmiths, University of London | Mastersportal\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"80f40c2e8d5f7992\">>>", "url": "https://www.mastersportal.com/studies/13561/media-and-communications.html", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"756a5b5890624522\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nYou choose 90 credits of options, at least 60 of which must be offered by the Department of Media, Communications and Cultural Studies.You will also complete a dissertation based on independent research, which is supported by a module in research skills training. In addition to the required core and option modules, a strong emphasis is placed on student participation in the research culture of the department and College. ... Apply anytime. ... For most taught degrees there is no official deadline, so it’s best to apply early to avoid disappointment.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"756a5b5890624522\">>>", "siteName": "www.mastersportal.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"335a49e723fe4685\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMA Media & Communications Postgraduate Programme By Goldsmiths, University of London |TopUniversities\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"335a49e723fe4685\">>>", "url": "https://www.topuniversities.com/universities/goldsmiths-university-london/postgrad/ma-media-communications", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d74f8d7d5249a5c5\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nLearn more about MA Media &amp; Communications Postgraduate Program By Goldsmiths, University of London including the program fees, scholarships, scores and further course information\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d74f8d7d5249a5c5\">>>", "siteName": "www.topuniversities.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1d793585e6c250f9\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMedia and Communications | Goldsmiths, University of London\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1d793585e6c250f9\">>>", "url": "https://www.postgrad.com/goldsmiths-university-of-london-media-communications-and-cultural-studies-media-and-communications/course/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7903934a348bfde3\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe Department of Media, Communications and Cultural Studies has been ranked 2nd in the UK for &#x27;world-leading or internationally excellent&#x27; research (Research Excellence Framework, 2021) and 16th in the world (3rd in the UK) in the 2024 QS World Rankings for communication and media studies. The Master of Research (MRes) degree prepares you for study at MPhil/PhD level.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7903934a348bfde3\">>>", "siteName": "www.postgrad.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e9ad8ddf8c6d3c87\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nPostgraduate courses | Goldsmiths, University of London\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e9ad8ddf8c6d3c87\">>>", "url": "https://www.gold.ac.uk/pg/a-z/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0bfafb752a816d90\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nA full list of all of the postgraduate programmes and degrees available at Goldsmiths, University of London in all departments.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0bfafb752a816d90\">>>", "siteName": "www.gold.ac.uk"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775774069580}}
